{"id":"432637","name":"肉末秋葵蒸鸡蛋","author":"美女天天","authorId":"6241101","desc":"","cover":"images/432637/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"秋葵","amount":"50g"},{"name":"牛肉末","amount":"10g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1g"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2g"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"少量"},{"name":"蒸鱼豉油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材备好。","img":"images/432637/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"秋葵放入锅里焯水断生。","img":"images/432637/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成片放入深底盘里。","img":"images/432637/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋加的盐和水稀释搅匀。","img":"images/432637/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把蛋液倒入装有秋葵的盘子里放入蒸锅蒸至定型。","img":"images/432637/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一点肉末放入炒锅加少许生抽，盐，料酒胡椒粉炒熟备用。","img":"images/432637/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒熟的肉末撒在鸡蛋羹表面。","img":"images/432637/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒上适量蒸鱼豉油。","img":"images/432637/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒上葱花接着再蒸5分钟美味即成。","img":"images/432637/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒸好的很好吃。","img":"images/432637/step_10.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}